  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling up the sustainable management of the Fall Armyworm in Africa, the Near East and Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This project will help to contribute to the control of the Fall Armyworm by contributing to the FAO Global Action for Fall Armyworm Control by scaling-up the sustainable management of the FAW in Africa, the Near East and Asia. Capacity development at root level, innovation, knowledge sharing and community-based FAW management pilots will be the main approach at national level. Sound policy coordination will contribute to disseminating best practices including standards on phytosanitary measures&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
